      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "Spans are created in **app4** code. Service name is fixed to `manual-python`.\n\n**GET /houses** (server)\n- `houses.list`\n  - `houses.read`\n\n**GET /houses/&lt;id&gt;** (server)\n- `houses.get_by_id` with `house.id` and `house.found`\n  - `houses.read`\n\nOpen a trace to see `house.id` and `house.found`. Those attributes are not Prometheus labels.\n\n**Route** filters server panels. **Manual span** filters child-span panels.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Span tree written in code",
      "type": "text"
    },
